OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying
OL,6,Fcloudy across the region overnight as
OL,7,Fshowers continue shift northwards
OL,8,Fthrough the early hours. Hill fog is
OL,9,Flikely on higher ground, though it
OL,10,Fwill remain mild for many.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FCloud will slowly break up
OL,13,Fduring the morning, allowing some
OL,14,Fbrighter spells to develop. Cloud and
OL,15,Frain however will return from the west
OL,16,Flater. Feeling warm, especially in any
OL,17,Fbrightness.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
