OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FA wet
OL,6,Fand cloudy start to Friday with rain
OL,7,Fclearing southward, drier and brighter
OL,8,Fbehind. Saturday looks more settled,
OL,9,Fbefore potentially some wet and windy
OL,10,Fweather moves in later Sunday.
